CHAPTER.VERS:
At the commandment of Aaron and his sons will be all the service of the sons of the Gershonites, in all their burden, and in all their service; and you

          {+}
         will appoint to them in charge all their burden.

and the pillars of the court round about, and their sockets, and their pins, and their cords, with all their instruments, and with all their service: and by name you

          {+}
         will appoint the instruments of the charge of their burden.
